{"id":1040801,"chapter_id":1040801,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"狄斯外缘 靠近砂海处\nMBCC外派小队任务执行中","style":12,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"外派专员A","content":"报告，运输任务已经完成。现第三小队听候指示。","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"车辆轻微颠簸，带着通讯设备的士兵沉默了片刻，点头回复。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"外派专员A","content":"是的，这次行动途中并没有获得目标相关的情报。明白，我们现在开始返航。预计将会在45分钟之内返回管理局。","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"通讯挂断，男人摘下耳机。一旁负责开车的同伴有些担心的看向他。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"外派专员B","content":"其他小队也没有找到海拉的下落吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"外派专员A","content":"没有，目前没人能联系上她，也没有她的去向信息。局长已经派人去她最后现身的那个集市搜索信息了，希望能找到点什么蛛丝马迹吧……等等！","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"男人猛地睁大眼睛——在道路前方，一道模糊的人影站在公路中间，正好在车子的必经之路上。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"外派专员A","content":"前面！前面有人！刹车！！","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"踩死刹车，金属磨片与轮胎将摩擦力发挥到最大，笨重的军用车难以抵抗疾驰的势能向着前方猛冲。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"砰——！","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"一声闷响，车头下沉，下一秒弹回原位。车终于在撞到人前停了下来，握着方向盘的年轻人鼻尖满是汗珠，惊魂未定地抬头。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"外派专员B","content":"这，这是……","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"一双皮靴踩在引擎前盖上。来者膝盖弯曲，身体前倾。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"content":"年轻女人低下头，凑近挡风玻璃，捋开被风吹乱的长发，露出一张阳光灿烂的笑脸。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"？？？","content":"嗨，你们好啊，MBCC的朋友们~","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"speaker":"？？？","content":"听说你们的老大最近弄丢了一只可爱的小老鼠？真巧，我最近在砂海闲逛的时候，顺手就捡到了那么一只灰扑扑的小家伙——","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"女人歪过脑袋，晃了晃手中MBCC统一派发的办公笔记本。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"？？？","content":"怎么样，带我回去和你们的“主人”聊聊吧？","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"speaker":"？？？","content":"哦？局长大人，你终于来了。","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1030900},{"step":21,"content":"女人面带笑容，斜斜地依靠在审讯椅上，姿势放松，表情调侃。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1030900},{"step":22,"content":"她肩头趴着一只画风格格不入的小生物——一只蜥蜴。见你进来，蜥蜴甚至向你点点头，似是在问好。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1030900},{"step":23,"speaker":"？？？","content":"听说你是个大忙人，还以为你会晾我个一两天，没想到竟然来得这么快。我还没参观完你的管理局呢。","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1030900},{"step":24,"options":["柯琳，对吧？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801025,"trial_step":25,"course":3,"drawing":1030900,"choices":[{"text":"柯琳，对吧？","goto":26}]},{"step":25,"speaker":"局长","content":"你不是想找我聊聊吗，现在可以开始了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1030900},{"step":26,"content":"你没理会她的玩笑话，直接在审讯椅对面坐下。女人也不在意，眯眼笑笑，直入正题。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1030900},{"step":27,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"看来你们已经调查过我的信息了，那我也不绕弯子了。局长大人，这个东西，你应该认识吧？","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1030901},{"step":28,"content":"柯琳向前附身，一扬手，一册笔记本顺着桌面滑向你的面前。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1030901},{"step":29,"content":"深色外皮，封面上印着MBCC的标志。这就是一本最普通的笔记，管理局几乎人手一本。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1030901},{"step":30,"options":["……什么意思？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801031,"trial_step":31,"course":3,"drawing":1030901,"choices":[{"text":"……什么意思？","goto":32}]},{"step":31,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"来，凑近点仔细看看……","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1030900},{"step":32,"content":"在你的沉默中，柯琳再一次迫近。她翻开封面，笔记本的第一页上写着歪歪扭扭的字迹，旁边还画着一只龇牙咧嘴的小老鼠——你能认出来，确实是海拉的手笔。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1030900},{"step":33,"content":"女人点了点纸张，话里带着隐隐的压迫。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1030900},{"step":34,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"这下明白了吗？局长，你的小海拉现在落在了我手上，这就是证据。","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1030900},{"step":35,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"原本还想带点更有说服力的东西过来，但她实在不怎么配合，我也不好直接上手，只好拿了点她身上的东西。","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1030900},{"step":36,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"如何，这下你愿意相信我了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1030901},{"step":37,"options":["这确实是海拉的手笔"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801038,"trial_step":38,"course":3,"drawing":1030901,"choices":[{"text":"这确实是海拉的手笔","goto":39}]},{"step":38,"speaker":"局长","content":"你说的没错，这是海拉的笔迹。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1030903},{"step":39,"content":"你平静地合上笔记本，在女人疑惑的注视下按亮了手边的终端。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1030903},{"step":40,"speaker":"局长","content":"送些茶水和点心进来吧，规格按照接待外客的标准准备，饮品冷热各一份。至于点心和水果……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1030903},{"step":41,"speaker":"局长","content":"柯琳小姐有忌口吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1030903},{"step":42,"content":"你抬眼看向对面的柯琳，充分展示MBCC的待客之道。而女人也配合着你摆出惊讶的表情。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1030903},{"step":43,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"局长大人这是什么意思？贿赂我呀？","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1030901},{"step":44,"speaker":"局长","content":"没什么，我只是希望这件事能尽可能和平地解决。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1030900},{"step":45,"content":"安排一切如常准备，你切断语音通讯，审讯室的大门打开，一个年轻文员端来点心与茶水。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1030900},{"step":46,"speaker":"局长","content":"海拉在你手上，而我关心她的安危，不想刺激到你……或你的同伙，导致她陷入危险。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1030900},{"step":47,"speaker":"局长","content":"直说吧，海拉到底在哪？你又想要什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1030900},{"step":48,"content":"柯琳没直接回答你的问题，而是先伸手捏起一块点心，不客气地塞进嘴里。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1030900},{"step":49,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"放心吧局长，这事儿我是单干的，没有同伙。","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1030905},{"step":50,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"砂海最近可不太平，单子也比往常少了不少，我现在兜里比脸上还干净，才不会找人来和我分油水呢。","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1030904},{"step":51,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"你也不用太担心，我不是什么凶暴的坏人，我只图钱，不害命，只要……","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1030904},{"step":52,"content":"擦掉嘴角的点心渣，柯琳冲你比四根手指。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1030905},{"step":53,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"只要你能出到这个数——我和你保证，明天一早，你的小海拉就能回家！","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1030905},{"step":54,"content":"四万？四十万？四百万？你看不懂赏金猎人们的“黑话”，皱着眉头发问。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1030905},{"step":55,"options":["你想要多少钱？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801056,"trial_step":56,"course":3,"drawing":1030905,"choices":[{"text":"你想要多少钱？","goto":57}]},{"step":56,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"不不不不不——不是狄斯币，我要的，是<color=#fb9259>异方晶</color>。","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1030905},{"step":57,"content":"四指并拢，在你面前的笔记本上轻轻敲了敲。女人的声音如敲击声一样清脆。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1030905},{"step":58,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"异方晶是好东西啊，平时都被那什么涅槃的大佬们牢牢握在手里，我们从航道旁边路过都要挨枪子儿……这么好的东西，我也想多囤点。瞧，这不是刚好有机会了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1030900},{"step":59,"content":"确实，异方晶是砂海真正的硬通货，售价高、需求量大、存量少……的确是最好的“敲诈”目标。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1030900},{"step":60,"content":"但即使是你，也没法立刻调用出如此巨量的异方晶。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1030900},{"step":61,"options":["异方晶？这个数量？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801062,"trial_step":62,"course":3,"drawing":1030900,"choices":[{"text":"异方晶？这个数量？","goto":63}]},{"step":62,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"没错，就要异方晶，这个数量。","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1030901},{"step":63,"content":"重复着你的话，柯琳身体又向前倾了几寸。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1030901},{"step":64,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"我也做了点事先调查，以局长你的身份，弄到这个数量的异方晶没那么难。","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1030905},{"step":65,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"就当是小海拉的托管费，只用花点小钱就能把她安安全全地换回来，这笔买卖还是很划算的。","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1030905},{"step":66,"options":["……"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801067,"trial_step":67,"course":3,"drawing":1030905,"choices":[{"text":"……","goto":68}]},{"step":67,"content":"划算吗？你不好说，只是这回为了海拉，你大概得掏一回自己的腰包了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1030905},{"step":68,"content":"低下头，呼出一口气，重新看向她。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1030905},{"step":69,"options":["好，我同意你的要求"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801070,"trial_step":70,"course":3,"drawing":1030905,"choices":[{"text":"好，我同意你的要求","goto":71}]},{"step":70,"speaker":"局长","content":"但明天早上，不管你用什么方法，海拉必须安全回到MBCC。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801071,"trial_step":71,"drawing":1030905},{"step":71,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"哇哦，爽快！不愧是米诺斯的局长，一言为定！","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801072,"trial_step":72,"drawing":1030900},{"step":72,"content":"你的妥协让柯琳十分满意，她身体放松，重新向后仰靠在椅子上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1030900},{"step":73,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"局长你不是调查过我的个人资料吗？我柯琳可是以做事利落、诚信可靠而出名的！","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801074,"trial_step":74,"drawing":1030901},{"step":74,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"对了，要不要留一个我的联系方式？以后有绑票或是其他需要的话——第一时间联系我啊，我给你打折啊。","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1030905},{"step":75,"speaker":"局长","content":"以后的事情先不说。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1030905},{"step":76,"content":"抬起手，你做出一个噤声的手势，另一只手回复着终端机上的消息。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1030905},{"step":77,"speaker":"局长","content":"异方晶已经凑齐了，他们马上拿过来。记住，如果你食言——","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1030905},{"step":78,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"那就天打雷劈火炮轰顶，从砂海道上彻底抹去柯琳的名字！别急，道义我都懂，肯定把你的小老鼠全须全尾安全送回来。","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1030905},{"step":79,"content":"柯琳话音落下，门外便传来一阵脚步声。看来是她的“酬劳”到了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1030900},{"step":80,"content":"只是她看向大门，并没急着站起来，而是饶有兴趣地看向你。蜥蜴也随着她一起凝视着你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1030900},{"step":81,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"一个、两个、三个……真有趣局长，你们管理局的异方晶都是由穿重甲的家伙护送的吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_82"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1030903},{"step":82,"options":["毕竟是重要物资"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801083,"trial_step":83,"course":3,"drawing":1030903,"choices":[{"text":"毕竟是重要物资","goto":84}]},{"step":83,"speaker":"局长","content":"异方晶可是重要战备物资，于情于理都该由FAC护送。而且，我刚刚还拜托他们帮我一个小忙。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1030903},{"step":84,"speaker":"局长","content":"——控制禁闭者柯琳，前往砂海，夺回MBCC的同伴。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1030903},{"step":85,"content":"脚步声越来越大。谈判已经被掀桌，那么在外准备包抄的队员就没有了隐藏的必要。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1030903},{"step":86,"content":"十几秒后，守卫队员将包围整间审讯室，并控制离开的唯一出口。柯琳将无处可逃。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1030903},{"step":87,"content":"女人叹了口气，慢悠悠地抬手。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1030904},{"step":88,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"哎呀，不是万不得已的话，我也不想用这一招的……","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_89"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1030904},{"step":89,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"来，和“警长”打个招呼吧。","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1030901},{"step":90,"content":"话音未落，柯琳猛地扬手一抛，那抹灵敏的绿色高高跳起，直扑你的面门！","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1030901},{"step":91,"options":["？！"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801092,"trial_step":92,"course":3,"drawing":1030901,"choices":[{"text":"？！","goto":93}]},{"step":92,"content":"绿蜥蜴张开嘴，细长的舌头甩出一枚指节大的烟雾弹，叮当落地时，浓郁的烟雾升腾而起。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801093,"trial_step":93},{"step":93,"content":"砰！已经赶到门口的安保小队破门而入。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801094,"trial_step":94},{"step":94,"content":"你捂住口鼻，向前伸出手，试图抓住些什么，但女人的影子向后一翻，隐没在烟雾中。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801095,"trial_step":95},{"step":95,"speaker":"尤金","content":"确认局长方向，控制禁闭者！","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_96"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801096,"trial_step":96},{"step":96,"content":"烟雾仍在扩散，很快笼罩了整个审讯室。视线中只有浓郁的白色，你能听到身旁安保小队的脚步声，却无法确认他们的方位。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801097,"trial_step":97},{"step":97,"content":"向后退开几步，你试图找到墙壁以确认方向，却撞上一具温热的身体。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801098,"trial_step":98},{"step":98,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"大·局·长——","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_99"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801099,"trial_step":99},{"step":99,"content":"女人的声音从身后响起，冰冷的枪管贴上你的后颈，而她爆发出的狂厄让你身体麻痹，动弹不得。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801100,"trial_step":100},{"step":100,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"被摆一道的感觉怎么样？","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_101"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801101,"trial_step":101},{"step":101,"content":"柯琳伸出手，从你肩头接回她的小蜥蜴——那只“警长”。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801102,"trial_step":102},{"step":102,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"我知道，把麻醉烟雾弹藏在蜥蜴嘴里骗过你们的安全搜查是有点作弊，但……","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_103"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801103,"trial_step":103},{"step":103,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"如果不是你先违反约定，让人对我动手，我也不会用这么一手脏招呀？","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_104"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801104,"trial_step":104},{"step":104,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"谈判破裂，这下，你的小老鼠就只能归我了~","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_105"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801105,"trial_step":105},{"step":105,"content":"枪管移开，柯琳把你向前猛地一推。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801106,"trial_step":106},{"step":106,"speaker":"尤金","content":"局长！","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_107"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801107,"trial_step":107},{"step":107,"content":"尤金迅速将你护在身后，而另一侧，两名守卫双双倒地。柯琳的身影消失在走廊另一头。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801108,"trial_step":108},{"step":108,"speaker":"尤金","content":"夜莺副官调派的帮手很快就到，我们现在去封锁出口，还来得及！","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_109"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801109,"trial_step":109},{"step":109,"speaker":"局长","content":"不……不用，让她走。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801110,"trial_step":110},{"step":110,"content":"你抬起手，从脚边散开的档案袋中捡起几张纸。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801111,"trial_step":111},{"step":111,"content":"这是刚刚还未用上的调查档案，记录了MBCC所调查到的所有与柯琳有关的信息。单打独斗的赏金猎人、砂海集市、几个搜不出任何信息的落脚点……","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801112,"trial_step":112},{"step":112,"content":"还有一个关键词，<color=#fb9259>图科</color>。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801113,"trial_step":113},{"step":113,"content":"你在档案中附带的砂海地图上画出几个红圈，它们四处散落，恰巧的围绕成了一个模糊的圈。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801114,"trial_step":114},{"step":114,"speaker":"局长","content":"她既然敢来，就一定还有逃命用的后手。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801115,"trial_step":115},{"step":115,"content":"红笔圈出一处空白，你将地图交给身旁的安保队员。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801116,"trial_step":116},{"step":116,"speaker":"局长","content":"我们需要这个范围内的所有城市、小镇或是村落的消息。她的同伙就在这里，八成还带着海拉。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801117,"trial_step":117},{"step":117,"speaker":"局长","content":"除此之外，我还需要你们去砂海集市做一件事……","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801118,"trial_step":118},{"step":118,"content":"【砂海集市】","style":18,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801119,"trial_step":119},{"step":119,"content":"MBCC发布了一条新的悬赏令：臭名昭著的骗子团伙“图科”已经落网，MBCC正在寻找将这伙人捉拿归案的功臣。","style":3,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801120,"trial_step":120},{"step":120,"content":"——这条消息不出两个小时，就传遍了砂海外围的几处较大的集市。","style":3,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801121,"trial_step":121},{"step":121,"speaker":"商人A","content":"嘶？图科？什么图科啊？你们有人去过这个镇子吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_122"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801122,"trial_step":122},{"step":122,"speaker":"商人B","content":"哎哟！苍天有眼呐！","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_123"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801123,"trial_step":123},{"step":123,"speaker":"商人B","content":"这群丧良心的骗子总算是惹到硬茬子了，活该被一锅端！","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_124"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801124,"trial_step":124},{"step":124,"speaker":"商人A","content":"啊？你知道那个图科的消息啊？不会举报他们的人就是你吧？这上面说是有不少奖金呢！","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_125"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801125,"trial_step":125},{"step":125,"content":"商贩们交头接耳的讨论着，并未留意到身后有人已经驻足多时。","style":3,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801126,"trial_step":126},{"step":126,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"你好，能把那张通缉令给我看看吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_127"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801127,"trial_step":127},{"step":127,"speaker":"商人B","content":"哦、哦……好啊，你看吧——","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_128"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801128,"trial_step":128},{"step":128,"content":"忽然被搭讪的商贩有些意外，伸手递出已经被揉到发皱的通缉令。","style":3,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801129,"trial_step":129},{"step":129,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_130"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801130,"trial_step":130},{"step":130,"content":"一串通讯号码和地址写在纸张的最下头。截止日期为……今日之内。","style":3,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801131,"trial_step":131},{"step":131,"content":"【黑屏】","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801132,"trial_step":132},{"step":132,"content":"MBCC砂船的防守比预想中更加懈怠。柯琳几乎没费什么力气就绕过了负责巡逻的作战队员，成功潜入船舱底部。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801133,"trial_step":133},{"step":133,"content":"贴着墙壁的阴影，她悄声来到能源中枢管理室门前。三条铁丝拧成一股，轻易地捅开了上锁的门。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801134,"trial_step":134},{"step":134,"content":"只要弄坏这里头的随便一个零件，整艘大船都会失去行动能力。一来一回换船的时间，又或者维修的时间，无论哪一个都足够她跑回砂海深处，带着整个图科跑路。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801135,"trial_step":135},{"step":135,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"……哈，这技能我可没白学。","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_136"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801136,"trial_step":136},{"step":136,"content":"无声地翘起嘴角，柯琳安静拧动门把，接着跳入黑暗中的房间——","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801137,"trial_step":137},{"step":137,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"——！","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_138"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801138,"trial_step":138},{"step":138,"content":"预先瞄准的绳网兜头而下，荷枪实弹的作战队士兵转眼之间就包围上来。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801139,"trial_step":139},{"step":139,"content":"柯琳抬起头，无数黑洞洞的枪口指向她，而在面无表情的士兵之后，散发着蓝色光芒的能源中枢旁，坐着一个熟悉的家伙。她低声笑起来。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801140,"trial_step":140},{"step":140,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"好啊，原来是在这儿等着我呢？","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_141"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801141,"trial_step":141},{"step":141,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"放出消息、疏散守卫……啧啧，狡猾的大人就是和小鬼头不一样啊，小海拉可比你这种老狐狸可爱多了！","voice":["vo_trial_40801_1_142"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801142,"trial_step":142},{"step":142,"content":"机会从来都是双向的。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801143,"trial_step":143},{"step":143,"content":"你看向举手投降的柯琳，站起身走到她面前。","style":3,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801144,"trial_step":144},{"step":144,"speaker":"局长","content":"好久不见，看起来我们可以继续上次中断的谈话了。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801145,"trial_step":145},{"step":145,"speaker":"局长","content":"——手下败将小姐。","style":2,"background":2002,"log_type":1,"src_id":140801146,"trial_step":146}]}